    <string name="accessibility_service_description">VodiGesture runs system and app shortcuts when you draw a gesture from the edge handle. It only reads foreground window changes to pick the right app rule, automatically pauses over passwords, the lock screen and sensitive Android 14+ surfaces, and never stores or transmits text, passwords or personal data.</string>

